  "details": "It's really hard to find the last instance that you've visited of a world. I found myself searching and randomly joining every instance to find the one I have visited the last time (before my game crashed etc.) - which sometimes means losing a potential friend forever. This can be very frustrating and sad. Please show me a history of the last instances that I have visited or make that instance the default option when I join a world under \"recent\".",
